<title>CHINA: China Jan-Sept kerosene output up 21.65 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Sept kerosene output up 21.65 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's kerosene output totalled 3.88 million tonnes in the first nine months of 1996, up 21.65 percent compared with same period of last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Kerosene production in September alone was 453,200 tonnes, the report said.</p>
